  "STILL": "Subtle idle motion only: gentle breathing, faint sway of cloth or foliage, slight ambient drift. Camera locked off. The image is a black-and-white inked drawing and must remain one in every frame \u2014 line weight, screentone dots, and flat black ink shapes stay exactly as drawn; no repainting, no photorealistic rendering, no colour, no added lighting effects.",
